1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,785
Bayangkan semua rekod, gambar, video dan
database…

2
00:00:04,585 --> 00:00:06,951
tiba-tiba jadi kosong.

3
00:00:06,901 --> 00:00:08,720
Buka gallery, kosong.

4
00:00:08,984 --> 00:00:10,601
Chat lama pun kosong.

5
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:11,829
semua hilang.

6
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:15,234
Pergi hospital, rekod kesihatan korang pun
kosong.

7
00:00:15,184 --> 00:00:16,115
Nak naik flight?

8
00:00:16,383 --> 00:00:18,494
Sistem pun tak kenal siapa korang.

9
00:00:18,544 --> 00:00:22,320
Tapi yang paling seram… duit dalam bank...

10
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:25,151
Korang ingat duit tu duduk dalam peti besi
ke?

11
00:00:25,426 --> 00:00:30,289
Sebenarnya tidak, sebab kebanyakannya cuma
sekadar nombor dalam database.

12
00:00:30,239 --> 00:00:33,816
Jadi kalau data hilang, nombor tu pun akan
hilang.

13
00:00:33,916 --> 00:00:37,309
Semua data ni sebenarnya disimpan dalam
data center.

14
00:00:37,554 --> 00:00:41,289
Berderet-deret hard disk, simpan nombor
kosong dan satu.

15
00:00:41,239 --> 00:00:44,775
Sebab tu syarikat besar takkan simpan satu
salinan je.

16
00:00:44,575 --> 00:00:48,482
Dorang akan buat backup, also dekat banyak
tempat.

17
00:00:48,432 --> 00:00:52,240
Jadi kalau satu rosak, salinan lain tu
masih ada.

18
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:54,372
Sebab tu backup data tu penting.

19
00:00:54,172 --> 00:00:57,568
Data apa yang korang paling takut untuk
hilang?

20
00:00:57,368 --> 00:00:58,638
Komen bawah!
